flowchart LR
  goal([定義成功標準]) --> draft[寫第一版 Prompt]
  draft --> tech{加上技巧}
  tech --> few-shot[給範例<br/>Few-shot]
  tech --> chain-of-thought[要求逐步推理<br/>Chain-of-Thought]
  tech --> system-prompt[設定角色<br/>System Prompt]
  few-shot --> eval[跑 Eval 測試]
  chain-of-thought --> eval
  system-prompt --> eval
  eval -- 分數不夠就改 --> draft
